---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="Submit an opportunity" description="Suggest a student opportunity in Armenia or correct an existing listing with supporting official sources."><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About', href: '/about/' },{ label: 'Submit an Opportunity' }]} /><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Help improve the directory</span><h1>Something worth sharing?</h1><p>Suggest an opportunity or a correction through the StudentOffers project on GitHub.</p></header><article class="prose"><h2>Include the details that matter.</h2><ul><li>Provider and offer or program name.</li><li>An official source URL.</li><li>Benefits, prices, eligibility, and any important restrictions.</li><li>Application procedure and opening or closing dates, where published.</li><li>For corrections, the listing URL and the detail that needs updating.</li></ul><p>Suggestions need review before publication. Please share public offer information only; we do not need a copy of your student ID or other personal documents.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/demidmorozov/studentoffers/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest on GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><p class="small-note">A GitHub account is required to open an issue. You can also review the <a href="https://github.com/demidmorozov/studentoffers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">project repository<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p></article></div></Layout>
